// Rule 98: intelligence advises, execution decides. A model's output is a
// proposal -- reviewable, dismissible -- and becomes a commit only through an
// authority the declaration NAMES.
//
// This one acts and names nobody, so the proposal has quietly become a commit
// and there is no answer to "who did this?" when the ledger is read back.
//
// Expected: PROPOSAL_COMMITS

DEFINE INTERACTION suggest_reconciliation (
  SATISFIES [ACT],
  ALWAYS_REACHABLE [UNDO, CANCEL],
  ROLE proposal
)
